<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --><!-- 📖 SECCIÓN: CITA BÍBLICA                                    --><!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="relative w-full py-10 sm:py-14 overflow-hidden" id="seccion-cita">
    <!-- IMAGEN DE FONDO TRANSLUCIDA -->
    <img
        src="/imagenes/carrusel7.webp"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 pointer-events-none select-none"
        style="object-position: center 40%; -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent 100%);"
    />

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center" id="cita-container">
            <p
                class="font-great-vibes text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#122a4d] leading-relaxed"
                id="cita-texto"
            >
                &ldquo;La vida nos enseñó que el amor verdadero es elegirnos cada día y caminar juntos con un corazón sincero, noble e incondicional&rdquo;
            </p>
            <p
                class="mt-3 font-crimson text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#122a4d]/70"
                id="cita-referencia"
            >
                Nos elegimos, hoy y siempre
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    import { gsap } from "gsap";
    import { ScrollTrigger } from "gsap/ScrollTrigger";

    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
        gsap.fromTo(
            "#cita-texto",
            { opacity: 0, y: 20 },
            {
                opacity: 1,
                y: 0,
                duration: 1.4,
                ease: "sine.out",
                scrollTrigger: {
                    trigger: "#cita-container",
                    start: "top 85%",
                    toggleActions: "play none none reset",
                },
            },
        );

        gsap.fromTo(
            "#cita-referencia",
            { opacity: 0, y: 10 },
            {
                opacity: 1,
                y: 0,
                duration: 1,
                ease: "sine.out",
                delay: 0.4,
                scrollTrigger: {
                    trigger: "#cita-container",
                    start: "top 85%",
                    toggleActions: "play none none reset",
                },
            },
        );
    });
</script>
